        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    spot_rate = 2.0979\n    domestic_interest_rate = 0.032875  # NZD\n    foreign_interest_rate = 0.016025   # GBP\n    period_days = 180\n    basis_points_multiplier = 10000\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    domestic_factor = 1 + domestic_interest_rate * period_days / 360\n    foreign_factor = 1 + foreign_interest_rate * period_days / 360\n\n    forward_rate = spot_rate * (domestic_factor / foreign_factor)\n    forward_points = (forward_rate - spot_rate) * basis_points_multiplier\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(forward_points, 3)\n```",
